214	    /** One line per grade (A, B, C) comparing the sheet, as it is now or as it stood at the end of
215	     *  {@code asOf} when given, with another sheet as it is now: the grade, then each sheet's summary
216	     *  due-total for it (the due-totals of the people not retired on it, n/a skipped), zero for a
217	     *  grade a sheet has no one on; no lines when the other sheet does not exist. */
218	    public List<String> compare(String sheetId, String otherId, LocalDate asOf) {
